// A variant's fields parse — both compilers must build the same tree for
// them — and the checker refuses them until an engine can run one. The two
// halves land apart on purpose: a grammar that only one compiler knows
// breaks the fixed point on every file, so it goes in first and alone.
enum Shape { Circle(r: Float), Square(s: Float), Point }
val p = Shape.Point
println(p)
